WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:06.601
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:07.422 --> 00:00:10.013
[Geiger counter clicks]
Eh, I'm being squeamish about this.

00:00:10.013 --> 00:00:11.257
[Geiger counter clicks]
I have my suit on.

00:00:11.257 --> 00:00:12.284
[Geiger counter clicks]
It'll protect me.

00:00:12.284 --> 00:00:13.845
[Geiger counter clicks]
I'm just missing the helmet.

00:00:13.845 --> 00:00:15.349
[Geiger counter clicks]
So, worst case scenario,

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:17.435
[Geiger counter clicks]
we're only talking brain cancer.

00:00:17.435 --> 00:00:18.752
[Geiger counter clicks]
I can live with that.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.613
[Geiger counter clicks]
Actually, that's kind of the point,

00:00:20.613 --> 00:00:23.174
[Geiger counter clicks, bullsquid spits]
I CAN live with--

00:00:23.174 --> 00:00:25.639
[Geiger counter clicks, bullsquid spits]
God damn! Get a handkerchief!

00:00:25.639 --> 00:00:28.747
[Geiger counter clicks, bullsquid spits]

00:00:28.747 --> 00:00:29.915
[Geiger counter clicks, bullsquid moans]
Snot monster!

00:00:29.915 --> 00:00:31.026
[Geiger counter clicks]
That's your new name.

00:00:31.026 --> 00:00:31.902
[Geiger counter clicks]

00:00:31.902 --> 00:00:34.087
[Geiger counter clicks]
But, yeah, unlike my colleagues,

00:00:34.087 --> 00:00:36.719
[Geiger counter clicks]
I seem to have a tendency to stay alive.

00:00:36.719 --> 00:00:38.687
[Geiger counter clicks]
Since this morning, I've been bitten,

00:00:38.687 --> 00:00:39.707
[Geiger counter clicks]
shot,

00:00:39.707 --> 00:00:40.494
[Geiger counter clicks]
bombed,

00:00:40.494 --> 00:00:41.806
[Geiger counter clicks]
electrocuted,

00:00:41.806 --> 00:00:43.172
[Geiger counter clicks]
almost drowned,

00:00:43.172 --> 00:00:44.918
[Geiger counter clicks]
almost fallen to my death,

00:00:44.918 --> 00:00:46.001
[Geiger counter clicks]
and strangled.

00:00:46.001 --> 00:00:48.203
[Geiger counter clicks]
Rasputin wasn't so lucky.

00:00:48.203 --> 00:00:51.454
[Geiger counter clicks]
But here I am, exposing myself to radiation.

00:00:51.454 --> 00:00:52.256
[Geiger counter clicks]
Why not?

00:00:52.256 --> 00:00:53.581
[Geiger counter clicks]
Let's add to the list.

00:00:53.581 --> 00:00:56.106
[Geiger counter clicks]
Maybe I can get burned, stabbed, and poisoned

00:00:56.106 --> 00:00:57.822
[Geiger counter clicks]
before the day's done.

00:00:57.822 --> 00:00:59.451
[Geiger counter clicks]
This is another dead end.

00:00:59.451 --> 00:01:00.918
[Geiger counter clicks]
Or maybe it's just flooded

00:01:00.918 --> 00:01:02.963
[Geiger counter clicks]
by radioactive green crap.

00:01:02.963 --> 00:01:05.274
[Geiger counter clicks]
Oh man, I wonder this is that same spill

00:01:05.274 --> 00:01:06.427
[Geiger counter clicks]
from this morning.

00:01:06.427 --> 00:01:09.306
[Geiger counter clicks]
That could be seeping everywhere!

00:01:09.306 --> 00:01:11.734
I'm not going to drink from the
water fountains anymore.

00:01:13.094 --> 00:01:14.400
Oh, hey, this is smart.

00:01:15.047 --> 00:01:16.467
This is a great idea!

00:01:17.257 --> 00:01:19.406
Yeah, let's crawl into
this drainage pipe!

00:01:19.406 --> 00:01:22.026
How could this NOT be the right way?

00:01:22.026 --> 00:01:25.146
Actually, I always wished I could
just hop in a giant pneumatic tube

00:01:25.146 --> 00:01:26.968
that would take me from my home to work,

00:01:27.283 --> 00:01:28.601
or to the liquor store,

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:30.016
the pharmacy,

00:01:30.564 --> 00:01:32.200
chemical supply warehouse...

00:01:32.729 --> 00:01:34.513
it would be really efficient.

00:01:34.513 --> 00:01:35.595
I am a gopher!

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.457
[bullsquid spits]
Oh, no, dammit!

00:01:37.457 --> 00:01:39.107
Snot rag...

00:01:39.107 --> 00:01:40.901
NONE OF YOU ARE HOUSEBROKEN!

00:01:41.739 --> 00:01:42.447
[bullsquid groans]

00:01:42.447 --> 00:01:45.100
I wonder if this is what
being a dog catcher is like.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.803
Actually, I don't think
they get shotguns.

00:01:47.803 --> 00:01:50.090
You probably have to provide your own.

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.968
[bullsquid spits]
God... more?!

00:01:53.409 --> 00:01:54.000
[bullsquid spits]
Eugh!

00:01:54.611 --> 00:01:57.093
[bullsquid moans]

00:01:57.093 --> 00:01:59.381
This is a pet-trainer's nightmare.

00:01:59.381 --> 00:02:03.551
You try and get it to behave and all
it does is puke snot on you and moan.

00:02:03.551 --> 00:02:04.868
This looks promising.

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:09.014
I'd like to see a dog catcher
handle this.

00:02:09.014 --> 00:02:12.210
If an alien teleported outside,
I could call them up and say,

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:14.932
"Yeah, I got a dog here. He's real mean."

00:02:14.932 --> 00:02:16.124
[bullsquids spit, Geiger counter clicks]
Then the catcher would arrive

00:02:16.124 --> 00:02:17.301
[bullsquids spit, Geiger counter clicks]
expecting a dog and get

00:02:17.301 --> 00:02:19.209
[bullsquids spit, Geiger counter clicks]
one of these bastards instead.

00:02:19.209 --> 00:02:21.264
[bullsquids spit, Geiger counter clicks]
And he can't just run away because--

00:02:21.264 --> 00:02:21.669
[bullsquids spit, Geiger counter clicks]
Dammit.

00:02:21.669 --> 00:02:26.274
[bullsquids spit, Geiger counter clicks]

00:02:26.274 --> 00:02:28.260
[Geiger counter clicks]
He can't just run away because technically

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:29.940
[Geiger counter clicks]
his job is animal control,

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.439
[Geiger counter clicks]
and this is an animal.

00:02:31.439 --> 00:02:32.337
[Geiger counter clicks]
It would be better if you could

00:02:32.337 --> 00:02:34.288
[Geiger counter clicks]
get some kids out on the street watching him

00:02:34.288 --> 00:02:35.482
[Geiger counter clicks]
so it guilts him into wrestling

00:02:35.482 --> 00:02:36.452
[Geiger counter clicks]
with the thing.

00:02:36.452 --> 00:02:38.145
[Geiger counter clicks]
Man, I'd videotape that.

00:02:38.145 --> 00:02:38.983
[Geiger counter clicks]

00:02:38.983 --> 00:02:41.770
[Geiger counter clicks]
This is a lot of radioactive crap.

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:43.857
[Geiger counter clicks]
I bet some people would pay money to get bit

00:02:43.857 --> 00:02:45.574
[Geiger counter clicks]
a radioactive alien.

00:02:45.574 --> 00:02:46.631
[Geiger counter clicks]
Not me!

00:02:46.631 --> 00:02:47.939
[Geiger counter clicks]
I know better!

00:02:47.939 --> 00:02:48.467
[Geiger counter clicks]
That always--

00:02:48.784 --> 00:02:50.776
[Geiger counter clicks]
pissed me off about Spider-Man,

00:02:50.776 --> 00:02:51.491
[bullsquids spit, Geiger counter clicks]
how he got...

00:02:51.491 --> 00:02:52.906
[bullsquids spit, Geiger counter clicks]

00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:53.544
[bullsquids spit, Geiger counter clicks]
NO!

00:02:53.544 --> 00:02:54.098
[Geiger counter clicks]
BAD THING!

00:02:54.098 --> 00:02:55.402
[Geiger counter clicks]

00:02:55.402 --> 00:02:56.058
[Geiger counter clicks]
BAD!

00:02:56.058 --> 00:02:57.740
[Geiger counter clicks]

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.374
[Geiger counter clicks]
...how Spider-Man got super powers

00:02:59.374 --> 00:03:01.135
[Geiger counter clicks]
by bitten by a radioactive...

00:03:01.135 --> 00:03:01.587
[Geiger counter clicks]

00:03:01.587 --> 00:03:02.662
[Geiger counter clicks]
...spider.

00:03:02.662 --> 00:03:04.538
[Geiger counter clicks]
That is such bullshit.

00:03:04.538 --> 00:03:05.273
[Geiger counter clicks]
For starters,

00:03:05.273 --> 00:03:09.238
the odds of a random mutation
being beneficial are astronomical.

00:03:09.238 --> 00:03:11.890
But, more importantly, even
if you did get one,

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:14.066
you'd still have radiation poisoning.

00:03:14.066 --> 00:03:17.467
Comic book writers know about as
much about science as I know about...

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:22.518
...well, I'm not a good example
since I know almost everything, but...

00:03:22.518 --> 00:03:24.685
the point is, they could try harder.

00:03:24.685 --> 00:03:26.319
Hey, I'm up higher.

00:03:26.319 --> 00:03:27.957
I wasn't even paying attention.

00:03:27.957 --> 00:03:30.280
I wish I could just will myself
out of here like--

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:31.011
[bullsquid grunts]
Daah!

00:03:31.011 --> 00:03:32.348
[bullsquid grunts]

00:03:32.348 --> 00:03:34.534
I hate awkward pauses like this.

00:03:36.158 --> 00:03:37.023
[bullsquid moans]

00:03:37.023 --> 00:03:39.900
Of course, I'm the one who has
to break the ice.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.640
I have to do everything around here.

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:43.334
[houndeye squeals]
Stop that!

00:03:44.026 --> 00:03:45.458
Ah hah hah hah!

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:48.212
Today's lesson is on muzzle
energy and momentum.

00:03:48.212 --> 00:03:50.234
[houndeye charges up]

00:03:51.925 --> 00:03:53.763
Wow, that was fun.

00:03:53.763 --> 00:03:58.015
This might my second calling
after physics--shooting stuff?

00:03:58.015 --> 00:03:59.527
I don't want to join the
military, though,

00:03:59.527 --> 00:04:03.475
because there would always be someone
giving me orders telling me what to shoot.

00:04:03.475 --> 00:04:05.403
And they'd want me to lose my beard.

00:04:05.403 --> 00:04:06.467
Fuck that.

00:04:06.467 --> 00:04:08.430
I don't get what the big deal is with that.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.891
Soldiers had beards in the Civil War,
it worked for them.

00:04:11.891 --> 00:04:13.044
[houndeye chirruping]
Oh, I see you.

00:04:13.044 --> 00:04:14.857
[explosion]
WHOA!

00:04:14.857 --> 00:04:16.821
COMBO PLATTER!

00:04:16.821 --> 00:04:18.710
Hope I don't need to go that way.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:21.296
I wasn't really expecting that to happen.

00:04:21.296 --> 00:04:23.463
I DO need to go that way.

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:25.132
Hey! You're hiding!

00:04:25.132 --> 00:04:25.534
[houndeye charging up]

00:04:26.517 --> 00:04:29.520
I play hide-and-go-seek for keeps.

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:31.644
You should've picked a better spot.

00:04:31.644 --> 00:04:33.868
No one hides from me.

00:04:34.352 --> 00:04:37.422
[bullsquid spits]
Wow, those snot freaks have good eyesight.

00:04:37.422 --> 00:04:38.801
[bullsquid spits]

00:04:38.801 --> 00:04:40.424
[bullsquid spits]
God, I can barely see it.

00:04:40.424 --> 00:04:45.121
[bullsquid spits]

00:04:45.121 --> 00:04:45.979
[bullsquid spits]
Come on!

00:04:45.979 --> 00:04:47.361
[bullsquid spits]

00:04:47.361 --> 00:04:49.054
[bullsquid spits]
I need a scoped rifle.

00:04:49.054 --> 00:04:50.716
[bullsquid moans]

00:04:50.716 --> 00:04:52.594
See, I'm behind the curve on this stuff

00:04:52.594 --> 00:04:54.945
because I've never tried
to kill the president.

00:04:54.945 --> 00:04:56.374
I've never wanted to.

00:04:56.374 --> 00:05:00.030
Because I know as soon as I did,
they'd just replace him with somebody else,

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.932
so it's like, what's the point?

00:05:01.932 --> 00:05:05.357
Yep, this is the work of that
same catwalk contractor.

00:05:05.357 --> 00:05:06.979
Okay, I can jump this.

00:05:06.979 --> 00:05:09.245
I'm flying on the wings of radiation.

00:05:10.524 --> 00:05:12.089
Yeah.

00:05:12.089 --> 00:05:14.391
I wasn't worried about
not making the jump,

00:05:14.391 --> 00:05:16.063
but I honestly thought
the platform might

00:05:16.063 --> 00:05:17.423
collapse from under me.

00:05:17.423 --> 00:05:19.533
[lock buzzes]
That's the kind of day this has been.

00:05:19.533 --> 00:05:21.000
RRRRR!

00:05:22.864 --> 00:05:23.567
NO!

00:05:24.949 --> 00:05:27.100
GOD DAMMIT! THERE'S NOT
EVEN A DOORKNOB!

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:30.687
[metal banging]
Wait, what's that?

00:05:30.687 --> 00:05:31.067
[metal banging]
What?

00:05:32.422 --> 00:05:34.958
I thought I heard somebody
tapping out Morse Code.

00:05:34.958 --> 00:05:37.635
Why do I care? I don't even
know Morse Code.

00:05:37.635 --> 00:05:38.300
Ngh.

00:05:39.089 --> 00:05:39.701
It switched back...

00:05:40.764 --> 00:05:41.651
Who are you?

00:05:41.651 --> 00:05:42.200
YAH!

00:05:44.047 --> 00:05:44.667
Yuck.

00:05:44.828 --> 00:05:47.329
[metal banging]

00:05:47.329 --> 00:05:48.991
[metal banging]
God, what is that noise?

00:05:48.991 --> 00:05:49.948
[metal banging]
It sounds like the drummer

00:05:49.948 --> 00:05:52.036
[metal banging]
to some shitty garage band.

00:05:52.036 --> 00:05:53.368
[moaning]
Man, I'm getting old.

00:05:53.368 --> 00:05:54.538
[moaning]
This modern day music

00:05:54.538 --> 00:05:56.381
[moaning]
just sounds like noise to me.

00:05:56.381 --> 00:05:57.337
[moaning]
"Bang bang bang."

00:05:57.337 --> 00:05:58.358
[moaning]
It doesn't even have a beat.

00:05:58.358 --> 00:06:00.930
[metal banging]
SCIENTIST: Fire the... rocket engine...

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:02.333
[metal banging]
SCIENTIST: Destroy the damned thing

00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:03.977
[metal banging]
SCIENTIST: before it grows any larger.

00:06:03.977 --> 00:06:04.745
[metal banging]

00:06:04.745 --> 00:06:05.390
[metal banging]
SCIENTIST: Dah!

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:08.346
[metal banging]
I know! This music sucks, right?

00:06:08.346 --> 00:06:10.414
[metal banging]
Don't worry, I'll go make them turn it off.

00:06:10.414 --> 00:06:12.121
[moaning]
It's ridiculous.

00:06:12.121 --> 00:06:14.153
[moaning]

00:06:14.153 --> 00:06:15.864
[metal banging]
Yuck.

00:06:15.864 --> 00:06:18.250
[metal banging]
God, that's a lot of meat there.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:20.270
[metal banging]
I wonder how much these things can hold.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.333
[metal banging]
Like, if I could a herd a cow in here,

00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:24.523
[moaning]
would it be able to lift it all up and eat it?

00:06:24.523 --> 00:06:25.779
[metal banging]
It's worth finding out.

00:06:25.779 --> 00:06:26.997
[moaning]

00:06:26.997 --> 00:06:28.832
[metal banging]
Are you the one making all that noise?

00:06:28.832 --> 00:06:31.675
[scientist screams]
MONKEY ON A STICK!

00:06:31.675 --> 00:06:33.978
WE'RE GETTING FINGERED BY GODZILLA!

00:06:33.978 --> 00:06:34.887
SCIENTIST: NO! NO!

00:06:34.887 --> 00:06:36.361
SCIENTIST: GET IT OFF ME!  GET IT OFF!
FUCK!

00:06:36.361 --> 00:06:37.667
[scientist screams]
Nnnnghh...

00:06:37.667 --> 00:06:38.442
[moaning]

00:06:38.442 --> 00:06:41.738
Okay, I was waiting for an
opportunity to use this.

00:06:41.738 --> 00:06:44.142
And here it is. It's obvious.

00:06:44.142 --> 00:06:47.621
A HANDFUL OF SHRAPNEL
MAKES THE MEDICINE GO DOWN!

00:06:47.621 --> 00:06:49.558
[explosion, tentacles moan]

00:06:49.558 --> 00:06:51.974
[tentacles moan]
That'll teach you from making so much noise.

00:06:51.974 --> 00:06:54.204
You're lucky I don't call the cops,

00:06:54.204 --> 00:06:57.247
banging around like you're
more important than me.

00:06:57.247 --> 00:06:58.963
What's this? "Test Fire"?

00:06:58.963 --> 00:06:59.933
Yes!

00:06:59.933 --> 00:07:00.675
[panel buzzes]

00:07:00.675 --> 00:07:01.821
[tentacles moans]
Damn...!

00:07:01.821 --> 00:07:02.703
[tentacles moans]
I should get out here,

00:07:02.703 --> 00:07:05.121
[tentacles moans]
I really wasn't ready for this.

00:07:05.121 --> 00:07:06.172
[tentacles moans]
I was expecting some

00:07:06.172 --> 00:07:08.245
[tentacles moans]
shitty drummer practicing, or

00:07:08.245 --> 00:07:10.599
[tentacles moans]
maybe some scientist into indie music

00:07:10.599 --> 00:07:13.216
[tentacles moans]
playing some weird-ass whale song remix,

00:07:13.216 --> 00:07:14.841
[metal banging]
but not this.

00:07:14.841 --> 00:07:16.973
[metal banging]
This is even worse.

00:07:16.973 --> 00:07:18.797
[metal banging]
That's not a rope.

00:07:18.797 --> 00:07:20.667
[metal banging]
You can't fool me.

00:07:20.667 --> 00:07:23.645
[metal banging]

00:07:23.645 --> 00:07:26.267
[metal banging]
Agh, God! Jesus...

00:07:26.267 --> 00:07:28.019
[metal banging]
It's all over me.

00:07:28.019 --> 00:07:29.410
[metal banging]
That's right, the old layer

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:30.800
[metal banging]
was starting to dry,

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.609
[metal banging]
better baste a new layer of blood on me.

00:07:33.609 --> 00:07:34.697
[tentacles moan]
It's important to I maintain

00:07:34.697 --> 00:07:37.167
[tentacles moan]
a fresh coat of blood on me at all times.

00:07:37.167 --> 00:07:38.528
[tentacles moan]
Helps my sheen.

00:07:38.528 --> 00:07:41.232
[tentacles moan]
GUARD: Be quiet! This thing hears us.

00:07:41.232 --> 00:07:42.987
[tentacles moan]
I'll say anything damned thing I want.

00:07:42.987 --> 00:07:44.166
[tentacles moan]

00:07:44.166 --> 00:07:46.006
[tentacles moan]
Whoa.

00:07:46.006 --> 00:07:47.818
[tentacles moan]
Don't light a match.

00:07:47.818 --> 00:07:48.482
[tentacles moan]
GUARD: HEY!

00:07:48.482 --> 00:07:48.791
[tentacles moan]
Hey.

00:07:48.791 --> 00:07:50.011
[tentacles moan]
GUARD: HEY, OVER HERE!

00:07:50.011 --> 00:07:50.589
[tentacles moan]
I'm behind you.

00:07:50.589 --> 00:07:52.569
[tentacles moan]
GUARD: EAT LEAD, YOU OUTER SPACE OCTOP--!

00:07:52.569 --> 00:07:54.283
[metal banging]
OH! Shit...!

00:07:54.283 --> 00:07:55.405
[metal banging]

00:07:55.405 --> 00:07:56.133
[metal banging]
I'll just...

00:07:56.133 --> 00:07:57.790
[metal banging]

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.920
[metal banging]
Yeah, I'd better chill here for a minute.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:00.988
[metal banging]

00:08:00.988 --> 00:08:03.570
[tentacles moan]

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:05.194
[tentacles moan]
I'm going to need some earplugs.

00:08:05.194 --> 00:08:10.400
[tentacles moan]

